        "id": "LissandraPassive",
        "name": "Iceborn Subjugation",
        "maxRank": 0,
        "summary": "When an enemy champion dies near Lissandra they become a Frozen Thrall. Frozen Thralls slow nearby enemies and then, after a delay, shatter from the intense cold, dealing magic damage to nearby targets.",
        "bodyHtml": "When an enemy champion dies near Lissandra they become a frozen zombie that seeks out living enemies. Enemies near these zombies are <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slowed</span> by 25%. After 4 seconds, frozen zombies shatter, dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">((120 ~ 300) + ([[si:scaleap]]50% Ability Power)) magic damage</span>.",
