      "R": {
        "slot": "R",
        "id": "LissandraR",
        "name": "Frozen Tomb",
        "maxRank": 3,
        "summary": "If cast on an enemy champion, the target is frozen solid, stunning it. If cast on Lissandra, she encases herself in dark ice, healing herself while becoming untargetable and invulnerable. Dark ice then emanates from the target dealing magic damage to enemies and slowing Move Speed.",
        "bodyHtml": "Lissandra encases herself or an enemy champion in ice. Enemies are <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Stunned</span> for 1.5 seconds. When self cast, Lissandra enters Stasis for 2.5 seconds and restores <span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">(100/150/200 + ([[si:scaleap]]55% Ability Power)) Health</span>, increased by 1% for each 1% missing Health.<br /><br />In either case, dark ice eminates from the target, dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(150/250/350 + ([[si:scaleap]]75% Ability Power)) magic damage</span>. The ice persists for 3 seconds, <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slowing</span> enemies by 45/60/75%.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Units in Stasis cannot move or act, and are invulnerable and Untargetable.<br />This Ability <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Knocks Down</span> enemies.</span>",
        "iconFile": "LissandraR.png",
